  "title": "Egg Bake with Sausage, Bacon, and Veggies",
  "description": "Herbs, vegetables, sausage, and bacon bits join Cheddar cheese in this easy, kid-friendly egg bake that&#39;s a great breakfast dish any day of the week.",
  "authors": [
